Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.26,0:00:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.38,0:00:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.94,0:00:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that can't be beaten!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past every wall that's\Nin our wake, go without hesitation!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.76,0:00:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.86,0:00:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We just have to press on a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.70,0:00:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,To get to the answers we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.30,0:00:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We came to this new world\Nbelieving that surely someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.98,0:00:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We just might find the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.06,0:00:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All the pieces of our dreams\Nhave now come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.98,0:00:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Our bonds won't waver.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.38,0:00:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,With our dreaming hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on towards.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.66,0:00:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A bright new future.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.78,0:00:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.62,0:00:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.68,0:01:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.30,0:01:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that you believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.50,0:01:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.04,0:01:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past everyone that's in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.40,0:01:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on, never stopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.68,0:01:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Only look up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.42,0:01:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your head up way up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.42,0:01:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Always step up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.12,0:01:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If waves are rough, jump to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.08,0:01:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Never give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.88,0:01:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Our wishes, they will come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.86,0:01:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And lead us on for the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.66,0:01:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We drift on riding the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.92,0:01:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Towards another shore day by day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.80,0:01:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There are many meetings, many goodbyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.58,0:01:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Underneath the flag we fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.06,0:01:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll remember the pain within.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.78,0:01:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep it in my heart forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.94,0:01:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And never take it lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.08,0:01:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But I won't surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.92,0:01:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This freedom I will keep in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.12,0:01:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep holding on, never stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.72,0:01:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.52,0:01:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.60,0:02:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.28,0:02:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that you believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.42,0:02:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.98,0:02:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past everyone that's in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.32,0:02:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on. Never stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.90,0:02:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Only look up, keep your\Nhead up way up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.40,0:02:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Always step up, if brains\Nare up, jump to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.06,0:02:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Never give up, our wishes,\Nthey will come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.72,0:02:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And lead us on for the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.00,0:02:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.72,0:02:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,After leaving Fishman Island,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.88,0:02:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,the Straw Hat Pirates are making\Ntheir ascent into the new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.16,0:02:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The second half of the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.68,0:02:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's sailing so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.54,0:02:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, almost too smooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.60,0:02:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This feels great.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.90,0:02:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a technique called shower tempo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.52,0:02:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to try it too?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.26,0:03:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, it does look neat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.14,0:03:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.38,0:03:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I brushed my fur two days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.28,0:03:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What would really be\Ncool is if I could take a
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.74,0:03:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,bite of that fluffy cotton\Ncandy you got there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.44,0:03:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a cloud, silly. Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.34,0:03:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks so sweet and yummy. Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.16,0:03:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems there's something\Nsweet and yummy in the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.08,0:03:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't get me more yummy than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.46,0:03:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's great, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.78,0:03:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's see the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.14,0:03:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper, you might want to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.64,0:03:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yikes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.55,0:03:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I kind of think I wanted\Nto eat that thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.70,0:03:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.61,0:03:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,My first bath on the sunny in two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.94,0:03:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's even more luxurious with\Nthis gorgeous underwater view.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.90,0:03:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This really is the life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.20,0:03:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't they need you on\Nthe deck to navigate?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.72,0:04:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,They can take care of\Nthings themselves as long
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.72,0:04:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,as I go back up before we\Nget to an upward current.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.58,0:04:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I might as well take my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.38,0:04:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I can handle a sea monster or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.56,0:04:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Usopp, hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.28,0:04:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give me one more minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.10,0:04:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,If we're going to catch a big one,\Nthen the rope's got to be extra strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.34,0:04:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my. What's all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.66,0:04:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so excited to see Fishman Island on\Nthe way down, I forgot to catch some fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.08,0:04:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet we can nab something\Ntotally crazy down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.68,0:04:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And then Sanji can cook it up on the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.10,0:04:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as it pairs well\Nwith cola, count me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.04,0:04:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Seafood dinner, huh? I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.66,0:04:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But if we're going to celebrate\Nour trip to the New World,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.16,0:04:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,then I want some booze, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.66,0:04:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, which one of these\Nlooks the tastiest?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.32,0:04:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's pick something really juicy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.80,0:04:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That one would be good\Nfried with some salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.42,0:04:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Fried fish with salt, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.08,0:04:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.60,0:04:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Or we could slice up that\Nskinny one and grill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.40,0:04:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That works, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.74,0:04:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,How about that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.22,0:04:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nice and fat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.48,0:05:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go lay it and drown it in mayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.82,0:05:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? This guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.28,0:05:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, you'll eat anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.76,0:05:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That creepy thing will taste like\Ncrap no matter how you cook it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.38,0:05:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.29,0:05:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Meat is meat to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.86,0:05:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Second gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.54,0:05:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I could eat on that thing for\Nall week and still not get full.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.48,0:05:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now gum, gum, jet pizza!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.90,0:05:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's even uglier.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.58,0:05:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure the Sonny can carry it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.86,0:05:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's find out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.22,0:05:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry and catch it! Special\Nattack! Capture Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.98,0:05:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Look there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.00,0:05:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Jixi dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.80,0:05:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, I can't wait\Nto taste it! That nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.36,0:05:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't even look like a fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.16,0:05:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,More like a gross old man. Kind of.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.48,0:05:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the end of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.72,0:05:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.66,0:05:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, this is nuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.20,0:06:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Our dinner became dinner became dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.54,0:06:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Even better!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.56,0:06:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's roll it in!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.64,0:06:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that thing look like\Nit'll fit on the deck, Loopy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.08,0:06:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you think something's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.96,0:06:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The ship's all wobbly and\NLoopy and Usopp are screaming!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.12,0:06:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear, I can't leave those\Nidiots alone for ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.96,0:06:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,One sword style, 360 caliber Phoenix!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.84,0:06:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice one, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.72,0:06:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What's all the noise about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.22,0:06:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.66,0:06:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We just caught a fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.26,0:06:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.62,0:06:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Good job, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.14,0:06:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't say I've ever\Ncooked anything that big.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.22,0:06:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This should be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.40,0:06:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But, uh, looks like you got cooked.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.50,0:06:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And I haven't even told you the best part!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.86,0:06:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a giant fish inside of it\Nwith a giant fish inside of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.68,0:06:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm more concerned about\Nthe ship, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.34,0:06:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It kind of feels like we might be sinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.26,0:06:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, we're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.06,0:06:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.10,0:06:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that thing over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.96,0:07:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's some kind of sea snake!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.36,0:07:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.32,0:07:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Get closer, we can eat that too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.96,0:07:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we got more than enough! Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.70,0:07:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.04,0:07:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Whitebeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.78,0:07:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a massive whirlpool that\Nappears suddenly in the deep sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.72,0:07:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a liquid sea monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.96,0:07:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That looks pretty crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.10,0:07:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What have they done now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.96,0:07:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, that must be the Whitebeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.78,0:07:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They say that whenever a\Nship gets caught inside it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.78,0:07:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,it'll be found somewhere far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.42,0:07:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Usually without its crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.86,0:07:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.26,0:07:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They all died somewhere at sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.66,0:07:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to go, it's way too dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.50,0:07:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So they ended up somewhere\Ntotally different, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.32,0:07:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.23,0:07:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I say we jump in and see where we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.58,0:07:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.68,0:08:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.59,0:08:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to get away from\Nthe whirlpool right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.88,0:08:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.79,0:08:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard the navigator!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.92,0:08:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's change or course or die!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.68,0:08:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a giant fish?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.20,0:08:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.11,0:08:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus two more!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.03,0:08:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid argue!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.08,0:08:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never be able to move upward\Nif we're pulling that huge thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.48,0:08:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.39,0:08:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's caught in the whirlpool!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.50,0:08:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.41,0:08:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't lose the food! Yeah! Forget it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.50,0:08:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We're letting it go! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.96,0:08:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What about our dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.18,0:08:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if you get us all killed,\Nwe'll never eat dinner again!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.00,0:08:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you got into this much\Ntrouble in the ten minutes I left you alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.42,0:08:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.74,0:08:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky, use your coo to burst!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.24,0:08:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but it's super\Ntoo late for that now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.90,0:08:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't laugh at your own joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.26,0:08:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap, we are so dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.42,0:08:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Join the club!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.92,0:08:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.56,0:08:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, it's too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.72,0:08:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.62,0:08:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Just hold on tight, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.74,0:09:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,it's over now wait a sec\Nwhat's this big black wall
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.94,0:09:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,that sounds like singing i think it's a
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.82,0:10:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.73,0:10:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at those scars!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.64,0:10:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell you what, after me and my\Nfriends travel the Grand Line,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.90,0:10:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll come back here and find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.68,0:10:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Laboon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.50,0:10:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to wait for us here\Nand mine crocus, Laboon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.24,0:10:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, we'll be back. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.96,0:10:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Laboon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.24,0:10:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at how much you've grown.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.32,0:10:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.40,0:10:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not Laboon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.40,0:10:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He's supposed to be in the first\Nhalf of the Grand Line, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.36,0:10:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That whale's way too big to fit\Nthrough the hole in the red line, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.66,0:10:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.57,0:10:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,They're island whales.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.88,0:10:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing an entire pod is\Nextraordinarily rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.80,0:10:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.72,0:11:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Some of them have scars on their faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.44,0:11:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That look exactly like\Nthe ones Laboon had.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.50,0:11:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I noticed that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.02,0:11:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.62,0:11:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Laboon's really not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.20,0:11:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand her off. I love the crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.36,0:11:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to jump out things as proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.50,0:11:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Lapoon, don't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.12,0:11:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Please listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.94,0:11:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me, Brooke, from the Rumbar Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.36,0:11:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm your old friend. Easy, Brooke.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.94,0:11:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta step out of it, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.32,0:11:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not the same\Nwhale, okay? Let the boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.26,0:11:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, we didn't come\Nhere for whale watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.54,0:11:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We just escaped from\Na dangerous whirlpool.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.24,0:11:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna call Roll to make sure\Neverybody's safe and accounted for, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.56,0:11:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Nami? Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.76,0:11:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What about Robin? Over here. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.16,0:11:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.88,0:11:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't want those whales\Ncrashing into the Sunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.50,0:11:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.68,0:11:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you forget somebody? Yay, Sunny!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.38,0:11:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that you care, but the other six\Ncrew members are still alive too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.66,0:11:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the plan, Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.72,0:11:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's not do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.42,0:11:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, the lady says\Nnot to do anything for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.28,0:12:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel free to go back to whale watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.00,0:12:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.72,0:12:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Those whales are so big,\Nthey're creating a current.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.22,0:12:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not safe to go against it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.60,0:12:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll go the same way as them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.22,0:12:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's catch a ride on their current!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.86,0:12:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Tighten the sails! Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.16,0:12:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.32,0:12:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't Laboon come from\Nthis part of the sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.80,0:12:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you might be Laboon's relatives!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.56,0:12:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Brooke, be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.24,0:12:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Are any of you looking for a\Ncalf who was lost 50 years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.26,0:12:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he's still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.96,0:12:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He's living happily on the\Nother side of the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.16,0:12:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.06,0:12:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,According to my friend Luffy,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.84,0:12:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Laboon's gotten a lot bigger\Nsince the last time we met!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.70,0:12:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So there's no need to be concerned!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.96,0:12:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He wouldn't want that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.18,0:12:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch the dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.36,0:13:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo-ho-ho,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.02,0:13:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Gather up all of the crew. It's\Ntime to ship out Binks' crew,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.54,0:13:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,sea wind glows to where, who\Nknows, the waves will be our guide,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.82,0:13:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,or across the ocean's tide,\Nrays of sunshine far and wide,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.20,0:13:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,birds they sing of cheerful\Nthings in circles passing by.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.86,0:13:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Bid farewell to Weaverstown.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.38,0:13:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Say so long to Port Renown.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.46,0:13:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing a song, it won't be long.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.60,0:13:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Before we're casting off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.68,0:13:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Across the gold and silver seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.90,0:13:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,A salty spray puts us at ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.04,0:13:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Day and night to our delight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.14,0:13:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The voyage never ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.08,0:13:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Gather up all of the crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.42,0:13:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to ship out Vince's crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.58,0:13:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Pirates, we eternally\Nare challenging the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.40,0:13:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,With the waves to rest our heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.08,0:14:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ship beneath us as our beds.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.22,0:14:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hoisted high upon the mast.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.36,0:14:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Our jolly Roger flies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.28,0:14:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Somewhere in the endless sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.64,0:14:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Stormy winds are blowing by.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.76,0:14:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Waves are dancing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.98,0:14:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He's giving us a ride!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.00,0:14:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.06,0:14:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They're heading up for two.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.22,0:14:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Now this is what I call\Ntraveling in style.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.26,0:14:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So pound your feet and clap your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.50,0:14:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Till Sunday's return.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.28,0:14:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo-ho-ho.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.10,0:14:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, New Feat?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.66,0:14:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.12,0:14:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready, crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.80,0:14:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Count down with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.84,0:15:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten, nine, eight, seven, six,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.74,0:15:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,five, four, three, two, one!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.72,0:15:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.06,0:15:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.52,0:15:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.06,0:15:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really bad weather!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.80,0:15:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that lightning!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.06,0:15:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The winds are raging!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.00,0:15:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the water's rough, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.96,0:15:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The needle's going crazy! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.36,0:15:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Woo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.52,0:15:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't look right. The sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.26,0:15:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.52,0:15:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,How fascinating!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.48,0:15:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.39,0:15:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a volcano and everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.06,0:15:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down, Luffy! Listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.14,0:15:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,None of the needles are pointing there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.10,0:15:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.74,0:16:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Even for the new world,\Nthis island is bad news!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.36,0:16:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not what the volcano says!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.38,0:16:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The island is right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.02,0:16:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares about some dumb needles?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.12,0:16:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We go where we want!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.46,0:16:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What's gonna stop us? The fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.62,0:16:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't get any closer than this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.76,0:16:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is literally burning!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.50,0:16:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.06,0:16:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.97,0:16:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The ship's gonna catch fire! No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.42,0:16:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You super underestimate the sunning!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.14,0:16:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something wrong about this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.16,0:16:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.07,0:16:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The fish are dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.20,0:16:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,They're bones!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.11,0:16:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Bones!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.03,0:16:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And what is wrong with that, Braytel?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.36,0:16:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.46,0:16:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, this is weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.76,0:16:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't normally cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.68,0:16:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.88,0:16:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Does your stomach hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.66,0:16:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's a distress signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.98,0:16:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone close by is calling for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.14,0:16:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If I pick it up, can I hear them?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.02,0:17:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.02,0:17:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,More than half of those calls are fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.30,0:17:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This is likely just a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.92,0:17:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The Navy often uses this as a\Ntrick to hunt down pirate ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.48,0:17:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you pick up, they can determine your\Nlocation and launch a surprise attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.16,0:17:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.40,0:17:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's great advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.86,0:17:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure our captain has\Nother things to do than...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.42,0:17:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.64,0:17:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Monkey D.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.04,0:17:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, and I'm gonna\Nbe king of the pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.74,0:17:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to tell them all that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.04,0:17:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone help! What's\Nwrong? Please! It's cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.34,0:17:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We need boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.20,0:17:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's real hot where we\Nare, and who's boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.94,0:17:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,My friends are getting cut down!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.48,0:17:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,One after another!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.40,0:17:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The samurai is gonna kill us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.30,0:17:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.70,0:17:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, uh, who? Samurai?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.86,0:17:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.18,0:17:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Please hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.42,0:17:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on the island of...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.22,0:17:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Punk Hazard!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.72,0:17:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have much time left!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.94,0:18:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He's dead! Terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.54,0:18:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.45,0:18:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Smells like trouble's brewing out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.48,0:18:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean it's brewing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.04,0:18:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,He's dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.10,0:18:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's already brewed!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.04,0:18:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This is scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.86,0:18:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he was acting and\Nthis is just a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.94,0:18:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.02,0:18:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're so cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.78,0:18:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,A samurai's like a\Nswordsman, right, Brook?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.10,0:18:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, from a faraway land, an island\Nknown as the Kingdom of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.10,0:18:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Wano is closed off from the rest of the\Nworld, so most people know little about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.04,0:18:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, it's not even affiliated\Nwith the world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.80,0:18:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They say that their\Nsamurai are so formidable
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.14,0:18:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,that even the navy dares\Nnot challenge them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.04,0:18:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The legendary owner of this blade,\NShusui, may have long since fallen,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.70,0:19:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,but its story does not end here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.24,0:19:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,With you as its master, this\Nsword will surely be satisfied.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.12,0:19:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This body of a legendary samurai—how\Nshameful of me to allow it to no defeat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.70,0:19:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.54,0:19:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,never even heard of\Nthe place, but he said,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.44,0:19:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,"punk hazard, not the place\Nwith the samurai." samurai
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.76,0:19:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You think that's it right there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.46,0:19:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that's a logical conclusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.92,0:19:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Those portable transponder snails\Nhave a limited signal area.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.54,0:19:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.64,0:19:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight through the fire and help him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.60,0:19:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll die!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.86,0:19:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He's dead anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.28,0:19:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's a samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.92,0:19:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He sounds scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.94,0:19:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I agree!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.10,0:19:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Please hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.34,0:20:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on the island of...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.70,0:20:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Puck Hazard!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.36,0:20:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have much time left!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.96,0:20:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That was Luffy! No doubt!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.60,0:20:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Not ideal, but at least we know\Nwhere the Straw Hats ended up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.20,0:20:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Makes enough sense with the battle at\NFishman Island and what took place after.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.66,0:20:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The only question now is, did they answer\Nthe call for help or did they move on?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.26,0:20:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are the Navy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.48,0:20:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you just send me to jail?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.62,0:20:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything. What\Nthe hell do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.14,0:20:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We want you nice and crispy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.50,0:20:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you stop that already?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.38,0:20:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I warned you before, to Sigi—let's\Nchange course for Punk Hazard—hold!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.76,0:20:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,On smoker, it's deserted,\Nright after the incident,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.72,0:20:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,four years ago—they sealed\Noff the entire island.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.76,0:20:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely no one's there anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.78,0:20:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe they're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.78,0:20:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Frankly, I can't imagine anyone\Nsurviving in that living hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.10,0:21:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,but we're screwed if we're\Nwrong—change course immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.98,0:21:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Men, we're off to Punk\NHazard. Huh, you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.86,0:21:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Vice
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.96,0:21:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,admiral, that place is off\Nlimits even for folks like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.88,0:21:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't get to lecture me while\Nburning a man alive—come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.04,0:21:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,a man alive come on
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.60,0:21:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.28,0:21:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That settles it, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.94,0:21:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Just don't die. Yeah, you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.48,0:21:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This should be fun. Aren't fatal?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.16,0:21:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You won?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.44,0:21:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Good job, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.66,0:21:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanna go?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.76,0:21:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Trade with me, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.64,0:21:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.84,0:21:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a giant shellfish lunchbox. Woo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.10,0:21:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.06,0:21:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Milky Road, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.92,0:21:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.18,0:22:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure showed that wall of fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.98,0:22:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You can make them just like\Nthey do in Skypiea now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.14,0:22:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.06,0:22:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We still have to wait a minute\Nbefore they stabilize, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.20,0:22:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.08,0:22:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, time for adventure, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.18,0:22:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Lady Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.90,0:22:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.30,0:22:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.94,0:22:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Wish I could go, you lucky punks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.94,0:22:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll probably need\Nour help soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.78,0:22:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out for lava.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.38,0:22:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp, be brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.86,0:22:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone trade with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.40,0:22:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this shellfish is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.70,0:22:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're\Neating your lunch already.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.34,0:22:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, look over the edge,\Nthere's fire! Fire! This is fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.24,0:22:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp, you're scared over nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.94,0:22:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Will these clouds still be\Nhere when we need to come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.94,0:22:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, and it's still raining, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.12,0:22:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Island scouting weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.66,0:22:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's not!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.82,0:23:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami, are you certain that cloud\Nbridge of yours reaches the island?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.00,0:23:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.96,0:23:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't have handled that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.86,0:23:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Not with all my fur.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.80,0:23:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm hot enough already.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.54,0:23:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll bet this will work out fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.46,0:23:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.37,0:23:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We just needed one person on\Nthe team to keep Luffy in line.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.34,0:23:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like you cooked up\Na whole formula for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.90,0:23:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so considerate, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.64,0:23:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me make a dessert for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.22,0:23:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe something nice and cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.96,0:23:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay! Dessert!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.87,0:23:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.48,0:23:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,They've got a gate and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.40,0:23:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonder if there's a town.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.34,0:23:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Not likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.92,0:23:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever lived here before\Nprobably got burned to a crisp.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.76,0:23:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If there was a town,\Nthen it would be on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.00,0:23:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Wherever that call came from,\Nit must have been far away,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.88,0:23:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,safe from all of this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.60,0:23:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin, back me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.02,0:23:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I was skeptical at first,\Nbut the flavor is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.34,0:23:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is everyone eating\Ntheir lunch right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.70,0:23:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.61,0:23:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll eat it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.74,0:23:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm saving it for later.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.68,0:23:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,My disease is coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.68,0:24:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel it inside of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.14,0:24:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.52,0:24:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got can't go on this island\Ndisease, and it's terminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.96,0:24:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no. I know. Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.52,0:24:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that settles it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.26,0:24:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This is where the call came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.10,0:24:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.01,0:24:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He said punk hazard for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.02,0:24:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Get Mini Mary away from all that fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.62,0:24:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is the right island, but that\Ndistress call could have come from anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.92,0:24:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,How curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.06,0:24:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems the island is off limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.42,0:24:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Luffy, see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.26,0:24:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah? So?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.10,0:24:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I love danger. Not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.58,0:24:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The world government, Mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.98,0:24:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,They're running this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.70,0:24:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So whoever it was that\Ncalled for help was a marine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.34,0:24:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's obviously a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.90,0:24:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess we're done here, right, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.92,0:24:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.28,0:25:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop trespassing is a crime—are\Nyou sure you want to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.10,0:25:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh wait, yeah, I guess we're\Nalready criminals aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.76,0:25:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But the government you don't want\Nto pick a fight with them, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.86,0:25:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, we've done that too. Okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.28,0:25:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,but from a morality standpoint
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.70,0:25:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,that is stupid—why is it so hot?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.04,0:25:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking because\Neverything is on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.60,0:25:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt it's always been this way since\Nthe government built a fence here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.72,0:25:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Something happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.63,0:25:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,but what
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.16,0:25:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,it's not
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.52,0:25:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.96,0:25:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,bad—those aren't houses,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.87,0:25:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,clearly there's some sort of\Ngovernment research facilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.14,0:25:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So you think the volcano or something\Ndid this and then what they shut
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.40,0:25:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,the whole operation down or do you\Nthink they were up to something?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.58,0:26:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And they did this—the fact that the log
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.42,0:26:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,post didn't point to\Nthis island troubles me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.20,0:26:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But what does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.88,0:26:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,what does that mean
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.22,0:26:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.13,0:26:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Did that samurai kill you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.58,0:26:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're not dead yet, say so!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.40,0:26:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.76,0:26:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanna fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.62,0:26:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a killer!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.96,0:26:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll kill us too!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.24,0:26:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you have an appetite.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.76,0:26:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This is stress-eating, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.08,0:26:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, there's something else\Nabout this that's fishy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.76,0:26:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The guy making the emergency\Ncall said it was cold, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.70,0:26:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Please! It's cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.54,0:26:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We need Buzz! Yeah, he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.28,0:26:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But how can he be cold and on fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.30,0:26:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he's stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.10,0:26:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't, that's the issue here!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.88,0:26:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Can there be a cold place\Non a burning island?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.78,0:26:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps he was cold simply\Nbecause he was bleeding to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.42,0:27:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin, can you keep\Nthose stars to yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.86,0:27:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This is nice and cold, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.96,0:27:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The sky on the far side of the island\Nis different than the sky on our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.18,0:27:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost like the weather is the\Ncomplete opposite over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.56,0:27:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Not our problem, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.88,0:27:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a giant!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.24,0:27:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's way bigger than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.76,0:27:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,My goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.26,0:27:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.78,0:27:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Those things are real? Crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.00,0:27:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.94,0:27:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever this is, it must be a trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.28,0:27:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Those things are only in fairy tales.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.54,0:27:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet, just look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.14,0:28:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What else could it possibly be?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.32,0:28:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.76,0:28:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You
